# Agent tooling
.reasonix/
CMakeSettings.json
CMakeUserPresets.json

# Dart / Flutter
.dart_tool/
.packages
.pub-cache/
.pub/
**/doc/api/
.flutter-plugins
.flutter-plugins-dependencies
**/generated_plugin_registrant.dart
.flutter-plugins-dependencies
